{"id":"n71130-1-12","stage":1,"title":"이곳 · 这里","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71130-1-12-1","ko":"이곳 생활은 좀 어떠십니까?","zh":"您在这里的生活感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이곳","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"이곳：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71130","senseId":"1","lemma":"이곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}},{"text":"생활은","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"1","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생활은","audio":"/audio/5b0805835447f70c6e55.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"稍微、还","explanation":"좀 在这里缓和询问的语气，不是让对方做“一下”动作。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"어떠십니까?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떠십니까","audio":"/audio/c9eb1e6697b3fd2b22e3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7b06733762a4646","term":"이곳","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3","entryId":"71130","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["이곧"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"人或动物在一定的地方活下去。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"稍微、一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"在问句中缓和语气；本句礼貌询问对方在这里的生活如何。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ff3fdaa8db2098fc8fa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71130-1-12-2","ko":"네, 공기도 좋고 조용해서 좋아요.","zh":"嗯，空气好又安静，我很喜欢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"공기도","meaning":"空气也","explanation":"공기：空气；-도 表示“也”。","readings":[{"term":"공기","audio":"/audio/a2408f7470488114eeae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22637","senseId":"1","lemma":"공기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공기도","audio":"/audio/c4415694c3a5cb6ed8e7.mp3"}},{"text":"좋고","meaning":"很好","explanation":"좋다：好；-고 连接后面的“安静”，指空气好，不是“喜欢空气”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋고","audio":"/audio/4ee7875368450ba2475c.mp3"}},{"text":"조용해서","meaning":"安静","explanation":"조용하다：安静；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"조용하다","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58167","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조용해서","audio":"/audio/06950d2733aa75dead57.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜欢、满意；这里因空气好且安静，觉得这里生活很好。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아요","audio":"/audio/4e89f12afd275d8a286b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryI